  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help Cover Funeral Expenses for 2 Orphans</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2 children in care at Joseph House, a children&apos;s home we support in Ethiopia, died last week. Mekdelawit and Sisay did not have mothers or fathers but found a family at Joseph House. The cost of medical and burial for both children comes to $950 and any additional amount raised will go towards scholarships for the older children who are preparing to go to trade school or get further education.</narrative>
  </description>
